| Function | Signature | Description |
|----------|-----------|-------------|
| `point` | `<type> point(int geo, string attr, int ptnum)` | Read point attribute |
| `prim` | `<type> prim(int geo, string attr, int primnum)` | Read prim attribute |
| `vertex` | `<type> vertex(int geo, string attr, int vtxnum)` | Read vertex attribute (linear) |
| `detail` | `<type> detail(int geo, string attr)` | Read detail attribute |
| `primintrinsic` | `<type> primintrinsic(int geo, string attr, int primnum)` | Read prim intrinsic |
| `pointintrinsic` | `<type> pointintrinsic(int geo, string attr, int ptnum)` | Read point intrinsic |
| `attribsize` | `int attribsize(int geo, string class, string attr)` | Attribute tuple size |
