### Noise Tips
```vex
// Animate: add time to position
float n = noise(@P + @Time * chf("speed"));

// Change frequency: multiply position
float n = noise(@P * chf("freq"));

// Layer octaves (fBm pattern)
float n = 0;
float amp = 1.0;
float freq = 1.0;
for (int i = 0; i < chi("octaves"); i++) {
    n += snoise(@P * freq) * amp;
    freq *= 2.0;
    amp *= 0.5;
}

// Curl noise for smoke/fluid velocity fields
v@vel = curlnoise(@P * chf("freq") + @Time * chf("flow_speed"));
// curlnoise is divergence-free: mass-conserving, no sinks/sources
```

